   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>Actual is a local-first personal finance tool. It is 100% free and open-source, written in NodeJS, it has a synchronization element so that all your changes can move between devices without any heavy lifting.</p>\n<p>If you are interested in contributing, or want to know how development works, see our <a href=\"https://actualbudget.org/docs/contributing/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">contributing</a> document we would love to have you.</p>\n<p>Want to say thanks? Click the ⭐ at the top of the page.</p>",
